    <description>Inbound Agentforce Contact Center calls (plan 2026-10-07 §5.2). Links the VoiceCall to the caller (open Lead first, else an Account/Patient) by the caller&apos;s number in the formats this org stores (+12125550103, +1 212 555 0103, (212) 555-0103, 212-555-0103, 2125550103), then routes it to the EM Recruitment Contact Center queue (members = EM_Voice_Agents_Routing, mirrored from the EM_Voice_Agents roster by scripts/assign_voice.py). A failed link never blocks the call (fault → route). Owner routing, out-of-hours and the recording-consent prompt come later (client inputs pending). 2026-10-29: after linking, the dialed number (ToPhoneNumber) is looked up in EM Number Route custom metadata; a mapped number routes to its team queue (EM NY Recruiters / EM KY/TN Recruiters, round robin). Unmapped numbers and any fault keep the original route to EM Recruitment Contact Center. 2026-10-30: personal lines with a recruiter (Agent_Username__c) are offered to that recruiter first (preferred user, not required) and fall back to the team queue. 2026-11-03: Agentforce Voice on PSTN can&apos;t hand a call to a Salesforce Voice rep (escalation expects partner telephony), so calls escalated by the AI agent (VendorType VirtualVoiceAgent) on a mapped number aren&apos;t routed: a high-priority call-back task goes to the line&apos;s recruiter (team line: team member with the fewest open missed-call tasks), linked to the caller, and reasonForNotRouting = Disconnect. If no owner is found or anything faults, the call is routed as before. Lead/Patient match decisions now test the lookup output records (Caller_Lead/Caller_Patient).</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>fx_CallbackDescription</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Caller &quot; &amp; {!Get_Call.FromPhoneNumber} &amp; &quot; asked the AI assistant on &quot; &amp; {!Get_Call.ToPhoneNumber} &amp; &quot; to speak with a person on &quot; &amp; TEXT({!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}) &amp; &quot; (UTC). The AI can&apos;t transfer live calls yet, so please call back. Voice call: &quot; &amp; {!recordId} &amp; &quot;.&quot;</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fx_CallbackSubject</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Missed call (AI hand-off): call back &quot; &amp; {!Get_Call.FromPhoneNumber}</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fx_Dashed</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>LEFT({!fx_Digits10}, 3) &amp; &quot;-&quot; &amp; MID({!fx_Digits10}, 4, 3) &amp; &quot;-&quot; &amp; RIGHT({!fx_Digits10}, 4)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fx_DialedE164</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;+1&quot; &amp; RIGHT(SUBSTITUTE(SUBSTITUTE(SUBSTITUTE(SUBSTITUTE(SUBSTITUTE({!Get_Call.ToPhoneNumber}, &quot;+&quot;, &quot;&quot;), &quot; &quot;, &quot;&quot;), &quot;-&quot;, &quot;&quot;), &quot;(&quot;, &quot;&quot;), &quot;)&quot;, &quot;&quot;), 10)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fx_Digits10</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>RIGHT(SUBSTITUTE(SUBSTITUTE(SUBSTITUTE(SUBSTITUTE(SUBSTITUTE({!Get_Call.FromPhoneNumber}, &quot;+&quot;, &quot;&quot;), &quot; &quot;, &quot;&quot;), &quot;-&quot;, &quot;&quot;), &quot;(&quot;, &quot;&quot;), &quot;)&quot;, &quot;&quot;), 10)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fx_E164</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;+1&quot; &amp; {!fx_Digits10}</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fx_HasNumber</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>LEN({!fx_Digits10}) = 10 &amp;&amp; ISNUMBER({!fx_Digits10})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fx_Paren</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;(&quot; &amp; LEFT({!fx_Digits10}, 3) &amp; &quot;) &quot; &amp; MID({!fx_Digits10}, 4, 3) &amp; &quot;-&quot; &amp; RIGHT({!fx_Digits10}, 4)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fx_Spaced</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;+1 &quot; &amp; LEFT({!fx_Digits10}, 3) &amp; &quot; &quot; &amp; MID({!fx_Digits10}, 4, 3) &amp; &quot; &quot; &amp; RIGHT({!fx_Digits10}, 4)</expression>
    </formulas>
